    "detailed_description": "<strong>Did you ever dare to imagine that within this bleak, frigid world lies a realm of enchantment? Concealed in the obscure corners of this world, you'll find the undead, specters, and the mystical arts.</strong><br><br><i>Embrace the mantle of a mighty Mage and confront the enchanted undead, phantoms, and the sinister Dark Mages.</i><br><br><strong>&quot;You bear a momentous destiny, and now, it beckons you to follow its course.&quot;</strong><br>These were the words inscribed on the card from your uncle on your 16th birthday.<br><br>Within your uncle's gift, you discovered a box containing a modest wand and a link to a YouTube video.<br><br>Now, you must unravel the mystery surrounding your uncle's supposed demise, as your mother recounted...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/d899e67554db6d1c206623a241459e67.poster.avif?t=1752159552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/d899e67554db6d1c206623a241459e67.webm?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/d899e67554db6d1c206623a241459e67.mp4?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magic becomes your newfound path.</h2></strong><br><br>Picture enveloping yourself in a shroud of flames, rendering you untouchable, or conjuring a swarm of bees to assail any obstacle in your way.<br><br>Your selection among five Schools of Magic opens up a world of possibilities. Summon a diverse array of servants to battle on your behalf, unleash potent fireballs, draw stones from the heavens, and channel lightning.<br><br>The choice is yours regarding the type of sorcerer you wish to become: Fire, Earth, Water, Air, or Metal. Each element boasts its own repertoire of distinctive spells.<br><br>Certain elements prove highly effective against specific foes, while others are ineffectual.<br><br>Should you tread the Path of Fire, you shall command spells such as <strong>The Circle of Fire</strong> or summon the formidable minion known as <strong>The FireLord</strong>.<br><br>Begin your journey by mastering basic spells, and progressively, ascend to command ever more formidable incantations.<br><br>Behold &quot;Falling Skye,&quot; a spell that sends stones plummeting from the heavens to crush your adversaries.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/7f18c5906c0d93c2ce38c443f63e5767.poster.avif?t=1752159552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/7f18c5906c0d93c2ce38c443f63e5767.webm?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/7f18c5906c0d93c2ce38c443f63e5767.mp4?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Over time, you'll acquire diverse wands to empower your spellcasting. However, the true treasures are the Crystals, excavated from the depths beneath the earth, each bestowing distinct abilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/003da4b025a74f846ba456c1d838176a.poster.avif?t=1752159552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/003da4b025a74f846ba456c1d838176a.webm?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/003da4b025a74f846ba456c1d838176a.mp4?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Once your training is complete, you'll embark on the genuine adventure, encountering increasingly perilous adversaries. These formidable foes wield potent spells and summon monsters to fight by their side.<br><br>Upon finishing your training, you have the option to restart the game as a new wizard at a higher level. This choice allows you to explore various mage archetypes, testing your mettle and determination to conquer the game in a novel way.<br><br>Alternatively, you can immerse yourself in <strong>GOD Mode</strong>, where the limits of your power know no bounds.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Did you ever dare to imagine that within this bleak, frigid world lies a realm of enchantment? Concealed in the obscure corners of this world, you'll find the undead, specters, and the mystical arts.</strong><br><br><i>Embrace the mantle of a mighty Mage and confront the enchanted undead, phantoms, and the sinister Dark Mages.</i><br><br><strong>&quot;You bear a momentous destiny, and now, it beckons you to follow its course.&quot;</strong><br>These were the words inscribed on the card from your uncle on your 16th birthday.<br><br>Within your uncle's gift, you discovered a box containing a modest wand and a link to a YouTube video.<br><br>Now, you must unravel the mystery surrounding your uncle's supposed demise, as your mother recounted...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/d899e67554db6d1c206623a241459e67.poster.avif?t=1752159552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/d899e67554db6d1c206623a241459e67.webm?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936510/extras/d899e67554db6d1c206623a241459e67.mp4?t=1752159552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magic becomes your newfound path.</h2></strong><br><br>Picture enveloping yourself in a shroud of flames, rendering you untouchable, or conjuring a swarm of bees to assail any obstacle in your way.<br><br>Your selection among five Schools of Magic opens up a world of possibilities. Summon a diverse array of servants to battle on your behalf, unleash potent fireballs, draw stones from the heavens, and channel lightning.<br><br>The choice is yours regarding the type of sorcerer you wish to become: Fire, Earth, Water, Air, or Metal. Each element boasts its own repertoire of dis