ark on the genuine adventure, encountering increasingly perilous adversaries. These formidable foes wield potent spells and summon monsters to fight by their side.<br><br>Upon finishing your training, you have the option to restart the game as a new wizard at a higher level. This choice allows you to explore various mage archetypes, testing your mettle and determination to conquer the game in a novel way.<br><br>Alternatively, you can immerse yourself in <strong>GOD Mode</strong>, where the limits of your power know no bounds.",
